diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 7d96ac7..be17e3b 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -10,4 +10,4 @@ Installs auditd and applies a hardening rule set.
 | `auditd_num_logs` | `5` | Number of rotated audit logs to keep. |
 | `auditd_rules_path` | `/etc/audit/rules.d/hardening.rules` | Where the rule set is written. |
 
-The role restarts auditd directly after each change.
+The configuration and rules tasks notify a single `Restart auditd` handler, so auditd restarts at most once per run and only when `auditd.conf` or the rules file changed.
